OL,3,GNEWSAMayor eyes 2050 opening date for
OL,4,Aunderground trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create Greater Manchester's
OL,7,Fown London Underground-style transport
OL,8,Fsystem have been backed by mayor Bev
OL,9,FCraig, with 2050 eyed as a potential
OL,10,Fopening date.
OL,12,FThe scheme could cost tens of billions
OL,13,Fand take decades to build - with the
OL,14,Fneed for government backing - but has
OL,15,Fbeen described by Craig as the "only
OL,16,Foption" for the county's future.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
