OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor eyes 2050 opening date for
OL,4,Aunderground trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for Greater Manchester's
OL,7,F(TfGM) timeline for the project could
OL,8,Fsee detailed plans and a business case
OL,9,Fready by 2030, with a push to start
OL,10,Fbuilding by around 2040 and a 2050
OL,11,Fopening date.
OL,13,FCraig said: "In Greater Manchester
OL,14,Fwe've started planning for what future
OL,15,Fis possible, and that means going
OL,16,Funderground."
